            </div>␀␀␀
            <p style="color: #888;">No switches</p>␀␀␀␀
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <span class="logo">Seeed Studio</span> | Seeed HA Discovery v␀</div>
                <div class="sensor-value">
                    <span class="status ␀␀
        </div>
